{"overview":"ژنرال مست و خشن، همسر و خدمتکارش را به زور تحت سلطه‌اش می‌گیرد. وقتی همسر متوجه می‌شود که شوهرش و خدمتکار رابطه‌ای دارند، خدمتکار را از خانه بیرون می‌کشد، بی‌آنکه بداند که زن جوان باردار فرزند ژنرال است. سال‌ها پس از مرگ ژنرال، نسلی جوان‌تر با نگرشی نو به زندگی و مشکلات جدید ظاهر می‌شود... این درام ملودرامی با سبک پرزرق‌وبرق، به‌صورت آزاد از ایبسن اقتباس شده و جدیدترین اثر یکی از اسطوره‌های موج نو ایران است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"A drunken, boorish general tyrannises his wife and his maid. When the wife discovers that her husband and the maid are having an affair, she turns the maid out of the house, little realising that the young woman is pregnant with the general's child. Years later, the general is dead, and a younger generation has risen with a new outlook on life and new problems to face... This flamboyantly stylised melodrama, loosely adapted from Ibsen, is the newest work by one of the legendary figures of Iran's New Wave.","tagline_en":"","runtime":95,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["داریوش مهرجویی"],"crew_en":["Dariush Mehrjui"],"countries":["IR"],"cast":[{"name":"Amir Ali Danaei","role":"","photo":"/7tqNAwoMZEGBFvYjpN2mgVypWKB.jpg"},{"name":"مهتاب کرامتی","role":"","photo":"/b1t07sE5ygUqkgvmmhpdHAgMhUu.jpg","en":"Mahtab Keramati"},{"name":"همایون ارشادی","role":"","photo":"/gBoWtYN8Z8UunnCKVQmebWA0Qv4.jpg","en":"Homayoun Ershadi"},{"name":"Hasan Ma'juni","role":"","photo":"/3YLZurQdEkyHWQc8HghKLCQkisE.jpg"},{"name":"مهدی سلطانی","role":"","photo":"/qyb7zQfVP95Q41k3YDrbBlm9DdZ.jpg","en":"Mehdi Soltani"},{"name":"Melika Sharifinia","role":"","photo":"/a5AY2UK1BtRXCuxiCXCPxtCPKuM.jpg"},{"name":"Hengameh Hamidzadeh","role":"","photo":"/lDUC30ZlWd1dvq74AdI9J3hoztL.jpg"},{"name":"Soroush Khoobroo","role":"","photo":""},{"name":"Omid Golzadeh","role":"","photo":""},{"name":"Ahmad Yavari Shad","role":"","photo":"/7h6lEmTCva2u3kYXGsarVrBGLrH.jpg"},{"name":"Hossein Dalman","role":"","photo":""},{"name":"Mohsen Goharshena